{
  "kind": "package-tool-rows",
  "record_set": "check-that-everything-waiting-on-a-person-reaches-them",
  "what_this_is": "The tool row of the pure waiting-controls check (do-work/controls-check.mjs). It takes the cards it is handed and says which have no working control; it holds no key and reads no route. The workflow row that feeds it is in workflow_recipes.",
  "records": [
    {
      "id": "package::check-that-everything-waiting-on-a-person-reaches-them::tool::check-that-everything-waiting-on-a-person-reaches-them",
      "address": "package::check-that-everything-waiting-on-a-person-reaches-them::tool::check-that-everything-waiting-on-a-person-reaches-them",
      "path": [
        "current-item",
        "published-record"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "kind": "ai-tool-descriptor",
        "id": "tool:check-that-everything-waiting-on-a-person-reaches-them",
        "label": "Check that every waiting thing has a working control",
        "status": "active",
        "job": "Check the waiting things you gave me: for each one, say whether it reaches the person with a control (a press, a place to do it, or steps), and list the ones that do not.",
        "description": "Give cards: { sections: [{ id, batch?, finish?, cards: [{ id, title, does_in?, finish?, response?, detail?, source_reference? }] }], finishes?, origin?, served? }. Returns checked, without_control and broken (each { id, title, why }). A card that opens its own place passes only when its source_reference is a screen the catalog serves, or, for a calendar task, when served names tool:serve-the-task-pages. Pure: it reads nothing and holds no key, so served is the caller's word. Gap: a task's own entry on the page is not proven; the page is judged as served, not each task on it. A card whose id starts with check: is never counted.",
        "input_schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "sections"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "origin": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "The address the screens open on, to judge a card's place (optional)"
            },
            "finishes": {
              "type": "array"
            },
            "sections": {
              "type": "array"
            }
          }
        },
        "output_schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "checked",
            "without_control",
            "broken"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "checked": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "without_control": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "broken": {
              "type": "array"
            }
          }
        },
        "invoke": {
          "kind": "container",
          "files": {
            "package_files": [
              {
                "package": "check-that-everything-waiting-on-a-person-reaches-them",
                "paths": [
                  "do-work"
                ],
                "at": "/opt/check-that-everything-waiting-on-a-person-reaches-them"
              },
              {
                "package": "shared-code",
                "paths": [
                  "src/workspace/screens.mjs",
                  "src/who-does-it.json"
                ],
                "at": "/opt/shared-code"
              },
              {
                "package": "keep-and-wake-ai-sessions-on-this-computer",
                "paths": [
                  "src/workspace/surfaces.json"
                ],
                "at": "/opt/keep-and-wake-ai-sessions-on-this-computer"
              },
              {
